        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJb_a3lblTlL5GNIXrwEboRcAovNm6jZzLCgmuf2BUrLSmuJQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve had the opportunity to photograph one of Rehmat Decor’s beautiful setups, and I was truly impressed. Parbhjot puts so much care and elegance into every detail. She’s friendly, flexible, and easy to coordinate with, and her prices are very reasonable for the quality she offers. Highly recommend Rehmat Decor to anyone looking for stunning event decor and a great experience!!",
        "time": 1747584272,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "B Grewal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106235153873897643230/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKvZVfMKn7a9d91d8kzKiaB9-WmMAav-owi9GGPVp38zMJkGQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Such a pleasure and ease working with Rehmat. We got them to decorate our engagement and they beat our expectation, and made the hall look absolutely stunning. We received so many compliments on the decor. Absolutely grateful!",
        "time": 1751245103,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joban Singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114852107299312997977/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKjzKxi1PxOvYjBP8FfrnX6Bqq3QF8U4e-0msJ3GHMaOAzZ6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Thank you Prabh di for the amazing decoration you have done for my Jaago party. I will surely recommend Rehmat decor as Prabh gives 100% from her side by keeping the party’s budget in mind. Everybody appreciated the colour choices and the props she used for the decoration.",
        "time": 1748969590,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "GujuGaming",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118151562626913793946/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUZ2cjedKHxJT9hq3hETe7dEzlj8TVR5Yk7C4zODI08sAWsRLp-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "We found Rehmat Decor through instagram.\n\nIt was very easy to talk with. Work around our budget. Very efficient. We decided to have an arc with balloons!\n\nWhen she arrived for the setup, she comes pre-equipped with all tools and sprays required to setup. She even came the night before to bring all the balloons and came again the following day to setup. This even allowed her to scope the area to set the decorations so the colors match well.\n\nShe is very patient and understanding of the event requirements her efforts go above and beyond to make our event perfect.\n\nWe would have her decorate future events again!",
        "time": 1743809235,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Navjot Thind",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116342019955777645811/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU9B7DrDJ7833mpXhLGiN3hHxRqEDO_p6bhwQt0ZSxb-6Wdhnk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Prabhjot did beautiful decoration on my engagement. She goes above and beyond to make event look beautiful and affordable. She is great as person too.",
